      "content": "forget the help... that's not even real here. nobody is coming to save us. there's just us, the walls, and the sound of them getting closer. i just feel so ashamed. to live like this, scavenging for scraps, waiting to be captured like an animal... it's worse than dying. there's no dignity in what's left of me.",
